  "claims": [
    "Decreasing natural-rank strategies compute directed terminal routes.",
    "Actual local branching diagrams generate completed comparisons and comparisons of any two sink-ending plans by rank recursion and structural pasting.",
    "No inverse stochastic execution or global comparison constructor is added.",
    "The concrete single adaptive MAC example checks all four local branching cases using one two-edge versus one-edge relator schema.",
    "For all stages and all terminal plans, a generated comparison proves one error charge and a pointwise conditional kernel that retains secret/oracle state and full transcript, replacing only the result flag.",
    "Whole-diagram conditions feed the existing cached-condition repair theorem.",
    "An exact private-bit discard counterexample disproves general common-suffix cancellation."
  ],
