    "status": "guarded compiled metadata evaluation, not a theorem for the general condition-set formula"
  },
  "scope": [
    "Assumes a natural rank decreasing on every atom, a total strategy, one sink without outgoing edges, and actual local diamond diagrams for every atomic branching.",
    "Generic local diamonds and residual paths are supplied, not discovered; no general finite critical-branching basis theorem.",
    "Fixed stage n has finitely many reachable lower stages and relators. Nat-indexed rule schema is not a finite set of concrete generators.",
    "One existing adaptive attack, with preparation order changes on eight coordinates; attacker query order unchanged. No independent product games.",
    "Existing information-theoretic bound 1/256, not a new security bound or computational reduction. Native execution/time guarantees not extended.",
    "Terminal output is full MAC outcome with result=false, not Unit.",
    "Previous cyclic checked exchanges do not automatically meet the decreasing-rank hypothesis. General mixed transformations, copy/discard basis and intermediate-endpoint coherence remain open.",
    "Declared conditions/change sets are sufficient, not minimal. Direct reduction proofs of stage-3 membership hit recursion limits; final membership observations are guarded compiled diagnostics. Quantified semantic theorems have checked ordinary proofs.",
    "No total proof-size, complexity, minimality, or fair shared-proof baseline result."
  ],
